The screen lights up.
Here are my mother and my father.
They smile and wave.
"Hi darling," my mother says.
"Hi mom!"
"Hi dad!" I say.
I see a big garden on the screen.
It is a sunny day in Mexico.
My father has a cold drink in his hand.
I have a warm cup of tea.
"We are having a lovely day," my father says.
"How is your apartment?" he asks.
"Yes, how is your room?" my mother asks.
I lift my computer.
I walk around in my room.
"Look, here is my table," I say.
"And here is my window."
I show a bed and a closet.
"It is a nice room," my mother says.
I smile.
